Music (original composition, mix.py)
- Samples (CC0): VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios / Sam Gossner), Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios)

Sound effects
- All synthesized in mix.py with the library's core/audio/sfx.py (no recorded samples)

Facts
- 19th-century ice harvesting and sawdust-insulated icehouses (general history; no single source quoted). The calendar's 1806 is the year the first commercial ice shipments left Boston.

Libraries
- three.js (MIT), playwright-core (Apache-2.0), ffmpeg (LGPL/GPL), numpy and scipy (BSD)

